{"1818660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kalyskah", "steam_appid": 1818660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2573970], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/6477459284d30d0549f9fa109c84e8c0.avif?t=1779831187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras_big/6477459284d30d0549f9fa109c84e8c0.avif?t=1779831187 width=1560 height=1552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a vampire while exploring a dark fantasy open-world in this 3rd person RPG. Make choices to affect the betterment of humanity– or yourself; strengthen your vampiric skills to fight bandits, trolls, and undead; and entertain yourself in fully animated seductive scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/e583687b6f3a891275e8fd79f4eefa01.avif?t=1779831187\" width=600 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kalyskah Karnstein, the first vampire, who, for thousands of years, has created and controlled an army of vampires. When her followers worry that she is growing stagnant, threats quickly arise, culminating in one deadly betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confused and alone, after waking from a millennia of slumber,&quot;, Kalyskah sets on a journey to rebuild her lethal army and hunt down the culprit that sent her into this deep sleep. As Kalyskah, you must make allies with sorceresses, orcs, and humans to fight and regain the power you once wielded.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/093583979522a6a5496699fe6e919483.avif?t=1779831187\" width=600 height=144 /></span>We aim to make a game that will be satisfying to play and have well-polished, tasteful romantic scenes that blend seamlessly into the gameplay and narrative. The open-world area and game systems are under development and, currently, the game only has a few quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can expect:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Dynamic combat styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Fully voiced quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Character customisation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Level Up and attribute point system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Sneaking up on enemies to bite their necks and drink blood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Seductive encounters during both gameplay and cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • An array of clothes to discover while exploring the world and its dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • One-handed and two-handed styles of combat, using swords and a variety of other weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/367bafc03be00a1a64c7d7118bb7843d.poster.avif?t=1779831187\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/367bafc03be00a1a64c7d7118bb7843d.webm?t=1779831187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/367bafc03be00a1a64c7d7118bb7843d.mp4?t=1779831187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/539eacd358c3c348a337bc0dfaab2865.poster.avif?t=1779831187\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/