and drink blood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Seductive encounters during both gameplay and cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • An array of clothes to discover while exploring the world and its dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • One-handed and two-handed styles of combat, using swords and a variety of other weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/367bafc03be00a1a64c7d7118bb7843d.poster.avif?t=1779831187\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/367bafc03be00a1a64c7d7118bb7843d.webm?t=1779831187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/367bafc03be00a1a64c7d7118bb7843d.mp4?t=1779831187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/539eacd358c3c348a337bc0dfaab2865.poster.avif?t=1779831187\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/539eacd358c3c348a337bc0dfaab2865.webm?t=1779831187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/539eacd358c3c348a337bc0dfaab2865.mp4?t=1779831187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/dc5a56c4012c1c38d7f4ab0f53ded683.poster.avif?t=1779831187\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818660/extras/dc5a56c4012c1c38d7f4ab0f53ded683.webm?t=17798